          .proof
            %h6#proof Proof
            %p
              The only hard part is proving that, if
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi f
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi ℱ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %msup
